      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m just a ghost haunting my own life. for years, there was this... this light, this constant pull to create, to make something that mattered. but it’s just gone. there's nothing left inside. i sit at my desk and i just stare at the wall for hours and i realize i'm not even a person anymore, just a shell that's taking up space. it feels like the soul of who i was has actually died.",
